      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need some help writing a letter to our school board. they're trying to push this new sexuality education curriculum on the kids and i think it's way over the line. i want to argue that parents should have the final say in what their kids learn about these sensitive topics. can u help me draft something professional but firm?",
